🟧 4. Restrict Access to EC2 / ALB using CloudFront Only

हा security feature खूप important आहे.

Goal:

User → CloudFront → EC2
Direct access to EC2 block

Method:

EC2 security group → inbound Allow ONLY CloudFront IP ranges

AWS publishes CloudFront IP ranges list in JSON

Add to security group

Result:
✔ No direct EC2 access
✔ Only CloudFront route allowed
✔ Secure architecture

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
🟨 5. CloudFront with S3 Private Bucket

Private S3 bucket → direct public accessible नाही
CloudFront वापरून access देता येतो.

Steps:

S3 bucket → Block all public access

CloudFront → Create distribution

Origin = S3 bucket

Check → Origin Access Control (OAC)

Apply OAC policy to bucket

Now CloudFront content public but S3 private

Result:
✔ Secure
✔ Scalable
✔ Fast

